A value whose Jinja does not parse fails with exit 2 and a stderr message
naming the syntax error.

-- fixtures/cwd/plan.md --
---
title: Foo
---
# Body
-- cmd --
booping frontmatter-update plan.md "x={{ macro( }}"
-- exit --
2
-- stdout --
-- stderr --
error: value '{{ macro( }}': TemplateSyntaxError: unexpected '}', expected ')'
